  "releaseNotes": "v9.0.6: Simplified PvNugs handler interfaces - removed inheritance from MediatR base interfaces. Now only HandleAsync method required (existing code with both Handle and HandleAsync still works). Cleaner, more explicit async naming. Mediator continues to support both PvNugs and MediatR handlers. Previous: v9.0.5 updated pipeline constraint for seamless MediatR replacement.",
